<title>RUSSIA: ATHLETICS-CONFIDENT RUSSIANS NAME EUROPEAN CUP TEAM.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-CONFIDENT RUSSIANS NAME EUROPEAN CUP TEAM.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia on Wednesday named the</p>
<p>following team for this weekend's European Cup meeting in</p>
<p>Munich:</p>
<p>Men:</p>
<p>100m, 200m, 4x100m - Andrei Fyodorov, Alexander Sokolov, Pavel</p>
<p>Galkin, Alexander Porkhomovsky</p>
<p>400 m, 4x400m - Innokenty Zharov, Dmitry Kosov, Dmitry Bey,</p>
<p>Dmitry Golovastov</p>
<p>110 m hurdles - Andrei Kislykh</p>
<p>400 m hurdles - Ruslan Mashenko</p>
<p>800 m - Oleg Stepanov, Andrei Loginov</p>
<p>1,500 m - Sergei Drygin</p>
<p>3,000 m - Vyacheslav Shabulin</p>
<p>5,000 m - Alexei Gorbunov</p>
<p>3,000 m steeplechase - Vladimir Propin</p>
<p>High jump - Sergei Klyugin</p>
<p>Pole vault - Maxim Tarasov</p>
<p>Long jump - Kirill Sosunov</p>
<p>Triple jump - Denis Kapustin</p>
<p>Shot - Vyacheslav Lykho</p>
<p>Discus - Sergei Lyakhov</p>
<p>Hammer - Vadim Khersontsev</p>
<p>Javelin - Sergei Makarov</p>
<p>Women:</p>
<p>100m, 200m, 4x100m - Natalya Voronova, Marina Trandenkova,</p>
<p>Yekaterina Lesheva, Galina Malchugina, Olga Povtoreva</p>
<p>400 m, 4x400m - Olga Kotlyarova, Yekaterina Kulikova, Tatyana</p>
<p>Chikina, Natalya Khrushcheva</p>
<p>100 m hurdles - Svetlana Laukhova</p>
<p>400 m hurdles - Yekaterina Bakhvalova</p>
<p>800 m - Yelena Afanasyeva</p>
<p>1,500 m - Irina Biryukova</p>
<p>3,000 m - Yekaterina Podkopayeva</p>
<p>5,000 m - Alla Zhilzheva</p>
<p>High jump - Tatyana Motkova</p>
<p>Pole vault - Svetlana Abramova</p>
<p>Long jump - Nina Perevedentseva</p>
<p>Triple jump - Inna Laskova</p>
<p>Shot - Irina Korzhanenko</p>
<p>Discus - Natalya Sadova</p>
<p>Hammer - Olga Kuzenkova</p>
<p>Javelin - Oxana Ovchinnikova</p>
</text>
